>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"metric-box\">\n                <div class=\"metric-num\">1000G</div>\n                <div class=\"metric-label\">单月最高流量</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"metric-box\">\n                <div class=\"metric-num\">通用</div>\n                <div class=\"metric-label\">主流协议兼容</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"panel-note\">\n            提示：所有订阅服务均需配合兼容的客户端工具使用。请根据终端类型选择通用配置文件导入。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"plans-section\" id=\"plans\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title-wrap\">\n        <h2>服务方案与阶梯规格</h2>\n        <p>按设备规模与流量需求分级，阶梯式配额自由选择。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stepped-plans\">\n        <div class=\"plan-step step-1\">\n          <div class=\"plan-tier-head\">\n            <h3>基础版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n              <span class=\"price-main\">¥15/月</span>\n              <span class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥150/年</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-features\">\n            <ul>\n              <li>每月 100GB 极速流量</li>\n              <li>支持 3 台设备同时在线</li>\n              <li>解锁基础流媒体</li>\n              <li>普通线路节点池</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-action\">\n            <a href=\"#\">选择基础版</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"plan-step step-2\">\n          <div class=\"plan-tier-head\">\n            <h3>旗舰版</h3>\n            <span class=\"plan-tag\">推荐配置</span>\n            <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n              <span class=\"price-main\">¥35/月</span>\n              <span class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥350/年</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-features\">\n            <ul>\n              <li>每月 300GB 极速流量</li>\n              <li>支持 5 台设备同时在线</li>\n              <li>全节点原生流媒体解锁</li>\n              <li>IPLC 专线游戏加速优化</li>\n              <li>7x24 优先工单支持</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-action\">\n            <a href=\"#\">选择旗舰版</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"plan-step step-3\">\n          <div class=\"plan-tier-head\">\n            <h3>团队版</h3>\n            <div class=\"plan-pricing\">\n              <span class=\"price-main\">¥85/月</span>\n              <span class=\"price-sub\">按年付仅需 ¥850/年</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-features\">\n            <ul>\n              <li>每月 1000GB 极速流量</li>\n              <li>支持 20 台设备同时在线</li>\n              <li>VIP 专属高带宽节点</li>\n              <li>支持企业定制路由</li>\n              <li>专属客户经理服务</li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"plan-action\">\n            <a href=\"#\">选择团队版</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"guide-section\" id=\"clients\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title-wrap\">\n        <h2>客户端配置指引</h2>\n        <p>支持多操作系统通用协议，三步完成链路订阅。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"guide-grid\">\n        <div class=\"guide-card\">\n          <div class=\"guide-num\">STEP 01</div>\n          <h3>获取订阅信息</h3>\n          <p>完成方案订购后，在后台控制台复制通用订阅链接或下载配置文件。妥善保管该地址，避免外泄。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"guide-card\">\n          <div class=\"guide-num\">STEP 02</div>\n          <h3>载入通用客户端</h3>\n          <p>在 Windows、macOS、iOS 或 Android 系统的兼容客户端中，选择“添加配置”，填入专属订阅链接即可拉取节点。</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"guide-card\">\n          <div class=\"guide-num\">STEP 03</div>\n          <h3>选择路由策略</h3>\n          <p>更新节点列表后，选择所需地区接入点，将分流模式设为自动分流或直连规则，启动系统代理通道。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"faq-section\" id=\"faq\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"section-title-wrap\">\n        <h2>常见问答</h2>\n        <p>分类汇总日常订阅、设备支持与流量管理的核心事项。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-groups\">\n        <div class=\"faq-group-card\">\n          <h3>订阅与额度</h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-q\">流量按什么周期重置？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-a\">流量均自开通日起按自然月周期重置。已用额度归零，不累计至下一周期。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-q\">套餐中途可以升级规格吗？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-a\">可以。升级时补齐差价即可即时切换至新套餐，流量额度按新规则生效。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-q\">年付方案有哪些额外优惠？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-a\">按年付可享受折算后十个月价格的优惠，具体金额请参考上述阶梯方案对照表。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"faq-group-card\">\n          <h3>设备与网络接入</h3>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-q\">如何统计设备同时在线数量？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-a\">以短时间内建立活跃网络中继的独立客户端 IP 为准。超出限制时新设备将暂时无法连接。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-q\">需要安装特定的专有软件吗？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-a\">无需安装专有闭源程序。支持目前市面上各类遵循开源标准的网络协议工具，直接导入即可使用。</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"faq-item\">\n            <div class=\"faq-q\">遇到节点超时应如何排查？</div>\n            <div class=\"faq-a\">建议先在客户端内手动执行“更新订阅”，确认本地网络 DNS 配置正常，或切换至备选可用节点。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n    <div>创世 © 2025. 遵循通用网络协议标准规范.</div>\n    <div>服务接入与运行状态均以后台实时控制台为准</div>\n  </div>\n</footer>",
